<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><documents xmlns:xsi = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation = "HDocumentSchema.xsd"><document type = "H"><pnldref>H18924</pnldref><english><title>Relevant body fail to prevent facilitation of UK tax evasion offence</title><additionalkeywords><additionalkeyword>fails</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>failed</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>failing</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>prevents</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>preventing</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>prevented</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>facilitates</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>facilitating</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>taxes</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>evades</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>evading</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>avoid</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>avoids</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>avoiding</additionalkeyword></additionalkeywords><standardoffencewording>On **(..SPECIFY DATE..) at **(..SPECIFY TOWNSHIP..), were a relevant body while **(..SPECIFY PERSON..) committed a UK tax evasion facilitation offence, namely **(..SPECIFY OFFENCE..), when acting in the capacity of a person associated with you</standardoffencewording><legislation>Contrary to section 45 of the Criminal Finances Act 2017.</legislation><pointstoprove>date and location&lt;br /&gt;person commits UK tax evasion facilitation offence&lt;br /&gt;while acting in capacity of person associated with relevant body</pointstoprove><investigatoractions><investigatoraction><code>IA27</code><description>Confirm proposed charge is appropriately authorised (Police or CPS)</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA28</code><description>Ensure compliance with investigator's obligations re disclosure</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA29</code><description>Consider if case suitable for referral to Financial Investigation Unit and CPS